msgstr "此相机有透视匹配的线条"

#: interact.py:766
msgid "Pick a camera in the Perspective panel first"
msgstr "请先在透视面板中选择一个相机"

#: ops.py:151
msgid "Pick a photo file"
msgstr "选择照片文件"

#: props.py:106
msgid "Real length from the world origin to the end of the axis (scene units); the camera moves closer or farther, the photo does not change"
msgstr "从世界原点到轴末端的实际长度（场景单位）；相机会靠近或远离，照片不变"

